#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.view_page_home
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-5\"><b>In Belgium, you can find the elegance of "
"Maison Reverie in five beautiful locations.</b></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-5\"><b>ໃນປະເທດແບນຊິກ, ທ່ານສາມາດພົບກັບຄວາມສະຫງ່າງາມຂອງ "
"Maison Reverie ໄດ້ໃນ 5 ສະຖານທີ່ອັນສວຍງາມ.</b></span>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">A scent, a color, a feeling...</span><br/"
"><span class=\"text-o-color-5\">At <b>Maison Reverie</b>, flowers tell your "
"story.</span><br/><span class=\"text-o-color-5\">Reach out to us to imagine "
"together a creation that expresses your emotions with grace and refinement.</"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">ກິ່ນຫອມ, ສີສັນ, ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກ...</span><br/><span "
"class=\"text-o-color-5\">ທີ່ <b>Maison Reverie</b>, ດອກໄມ້ຈະບອກເລົ່າເລື່ອງລາວຂອງທ່າ"
"ນ.</span><br/><span class=\"text-o-color-5\">ຕິດຕໍ່ຫາພວກເຮົາເພື່ອຮ່ວມກັນສ້າງສັນຜົນງານ ທີ່ສ"
"ະແດງເຖິງຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງສະຫງ່າງາມ ແລະ ປານີດ.</span>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.view_page_home
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">Artfully arranged with rare and seasonal "
"blooms, our bespoke bouquets capture elegance and emotion in every petal.</"
"span><br/><br/>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">ຈັດແຕ່ງຢ່າງມີສິລະປະດ້ວຍດອກໄມ້ຫາຍາກ ແລະ ຕາມລະດູການ, ຊໍ່ດອ"
"ກໄມ້ທີ່ສັ່ງເຮັດພິເສດຂອງພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຖ່າຍທອດຄວາມສະຫງ່າງາມ ແລະ ອາລົມຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກໄວ້ໃນທຸກໆກີບດອກ.</"
"span><br/><br/>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.view_page_home
msgid "<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">Bespoke Bouquets</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">ຊໍ່ດອກໄມ້ສັ່ງເຮັດພິເສດ</span>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.view_page_contactus
msgid "<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">Contact us</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">ຕິດຕໍ່ພວກເຮົາ</span>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.view_page_home
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">Each boutique captures the spirit of French "
"artistry and floral passion, offering a haven of beauty where every bouquet "
"is crafted with care and emotion. Visit us and experience the poetry of "
"flowers, wherever you are in Belgium.</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">ແຕ່ລະຮ້ານໄດ້ຖ່າຍທອດຈິດວິນຍານແຫ່ງສິລະປະ ແລະ ຄວາມມັກຮັກດອກ"
"ໄມ້ແບບຝຣັ່ງ, ມອບພື້ນທີ່ແຫ່ງຄວາມງົດງາມທີ່ເຊິ່ງທຸກໆຊໍ່ດອກໄມ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍຄວາມໃສ່ໃຈ ແລະ ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກ. ເຊີນມ"
"າຢ້ຽມຢາມພວກເຮົາ ແລະ ສຳຜັດກັບບົດກະວີແຫ່ງດອກໄມ້, ບໍ່ວ່າທ່ານຈະຢູ່ໃສໃນແບນຊິກ.</span>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.view_page_home
msgid "<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">Floral Design for Events</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">ການອອກແບບດອກໄມ້ສຳລັບງານຕ່າງໆ</span>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.view_page_home
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">From intimate gatherings to grand "
"celebrations, our floral designs transform each space into a living dream.</"
"span><br/><br/>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">ຕັ້ງແຕ່ງານສັງສັນແບບອົບອຸ່ນ ຈົນເຖິງງານສະເຫຼີມສະຫຼອງທີ່ຍິ່ງໃຫຍ່, ກ"
"ານອອກແບບດອກໄມ້ຂອງພວກເຮົາປ່ຽນທຸກພື້ນທີ່ໃຫ້ກາຍເປັນຄວາມຝັນທີ່ມີຊີວິດ.</span><br/><br/>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.view_page_home
msgid "<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">Our French inspiration</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">ແຮງບັນດານໃຈແບບຝຣັ່ງຂອງພວກເຮົາ</span>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.view_page_home
msgid "<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">Our creations</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">ຜົນງານສ້າງສັນຂອງພວກເຮົາ</span>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.view_page_home
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">Rooted in the timeless art of French "
"floristry, Maison Reverie draws inspiration from the charm of Parisian "
"gardens, cobblestone markets, and the effortless elegance of everyday "
"beauty. Each bloom tells a story of romance, grace, and natural harmony.</"
"span><br/>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">ດ້ວຍຕົ້ນກຳເນີດຈາກສິລະປະການຈັດດອກໄມ້ແບບຝຣັ່ງອັນເປັນອະມະຕ"
"ະ, Maison Reverie ໄດ້ຮັບແຮງບັນດານໃຈຈາກສະເໜ່ຂອງສວນປາຣີ, ຕະຫຼາດຫີນປູພື້ນ, ແລະ ຄວາມສະຫງ່າງາ"
"ມແບບລຽບງ່າຍຂອງຊີວິດປະຈຳວັນ. ດອກໄມ້ແຕ່ລະດອກບອກເລົ່າເລື່ອງລາວຄວາມໂຣແມນຕິກ, ຄວາມອ່ອນຊ້ອຍ, ແລ"
"ະ ຄວາມກົມກຽວກັບທຳມະຊາດ.</span><br/>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.view_page_home
msgid "<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">Signature Collections</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">ຄໍເລັກຊັນພິເສດສະເພາະ</span>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.view_page_home
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">Timeless creations inspired by the seasons "
"where nature, artistry, and refinement meet in perfect harmony.</span><br/"
"><br/>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">ຜົນງານສ້າງສັນອັນເປັນອະມະຕະທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແຮງບັນດານໃຈຈາກລະດູການ "
"ບ່ອນທີ່ທຳມະຊາດ, ສິລະປະ ແລະ ຄວາມປານີດ ບັນຈົບກັນຢ່າງສົມບູນແບບ.</span><br/><br/>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.view_page_home
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">We believe flowers are more than decoration; "
"they are emotion made visible. Guided by French aesthetics and modern "
"artistry, our designs blend softness and sophistication, creating "
"arrangements that feel both classic and alive.</span><br/>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">ພວກເຮົາເຊື່ອວ່າດອກໄມ້ເປັນຫຼາຍກວ່າເຄື່ອງປະດັບຕົກແຕ່ງ; ແຕ່ແມ່ນອ"
"າລົມຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກທີ່ສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້. ດ້ວຍຫຼັກຄວາມງາມແບບຝຣັ່ງ ແລະ ສິລະປະຮ່ວມສະໄໝ, ການອອກແບບຂອງພວ"
"ກເຮົາປະສົມປະສານຄວາມອ່ອນໂຍນ ແລະ ຄວາມທັນສະໄໝເຂົ້າກັນ, ສ້າງສັນການຈັດດອກໄມ້ທີ່ໃຫ້ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກທັງຄລາດສິ"
"ກ ແລະ ມີຊີວິດຊີວາ.</span><br/>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.view_page_home
msgid "<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">Where to find us</span><br/>"
msgstr "<span class=\"text-o-color-5\">ບ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດພົບພວກເຮົາ</span><br/>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.view_page_home
