#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>\n"
"                    <font style=\"color: rgb(113, 75, 103);\">The Point of "
"Sale app </font><font class=\"text-o-color-5\"><span style=\"font-weight: "
"normal;\">h</span></font>\n"
"                </strong>\n"
"                andles in-store sales of bouquets, flowers, gift cards, and "
"more."
msgstr ""
"<strong>\n"
"                    <font style=\"color: rgb(113, 75, 103);\">ແອັບຈຸດຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານ "
"(POS) </font><font class=\"text-o-color-5\"><span style=\"font-weight: "
"normal;\">ຊ</span></font>\n"
"                </strong>\n"
"                ່ວຍຈັດການການຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານສຳລັບຊໍ່ດອກໄມ້, ດອກໄມ້, ບັດຂອງຂວັນ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>\n"
"                    <font style=\"color: rgb(113, 75, 103);\">The Sales app "
"</font>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-o-color-5\"><span style=\"font-"
"weight: normal;\">makes it simple to handle customer orders, including big "
"floral arrangements for weddings, corporate events, and other special "
"occasions.</span></font>\n"
"                </strong>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>\n"
"                    <font style=\"color: rgb(113, 75, 103);\">ແອັບການຂາຍ </"
"font>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-o-color-5\"><span style=\"font-"
"weight: normal;\">ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຈັດການຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ຂອງລູກຄ້າເປັນເລື່ອງງ່າຍດາຍ, ລວມທັງການຈັດດອກໄມ້ຂະໜາ"
"ດໃຫຍ່ສຳລັບງານດອງ, ງານລ້ຽງບໍລິສັດ, ແລະ ໂອກາດພິເສດອື່ນໆ.</span></font>\n"
"                </strong>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><font style=\"color: rgb(113, 75, 103);\">The CRM app</font></"
"strong><font class=\"text-o-color-5\"> helps you manage customer "
"relationships, event requests, and flower inquiries easily.</font><br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><font style=\"color: rgb(113, 75, 103);\">ແອັບ CRM</font></strong>"
"<font class=\"text-o-color-5\"> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈັດການສາຍພົວພັນກັບລູກຄ້າ, ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍຈັດງານ, ແລະ "
"ການສອບຖາມກ່ຽວກັບດອກໄມ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ.</font><br/>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><font style=\"color: rgb(113, 75, 103);\">The Purchase app</font></"
"strong> manages vendor and ensures your shop is stocked with the freshest "
"flowers."
msgstr ""
"<strong><font style=\"color: rgb(113, 75, 103);\">ແອັບການຈັດຊື້</font></strong> ຈັ"
"ດການຜູ້ສະໜອງ ແລະ ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຮ້ານຂອງທ່ານມີດອກໄມ້ສົດໃໝ່ຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><font style=\"color: rgb(113, 75, 103);\">The Website app </font></"
"strong>allows customers to showcase your flowers vision and services online."
msgstr ""
"<strong><font style=\"color: rgb(113, 75, 103);\">ແອັບເວັບໄຊ </font></strong>ຊ່ວ"
"ຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສະແດງວິໄສທັດດ້ານດອກໄມ້ ແລະ ການບໍລິການຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານທາງອອນລາຍ."

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Activate payment methods: </strong>Activate payment options such as "
"Cash, Card, Mobile Payments, and Gift Cards directly in your POS settings."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ເປີດໃຊ້ງານວິທີການຊຳລະເງິນ: </strong>ເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກການຊຳລະເງິນ ເຊັ່ນ: ເງິນສົດ, ບັດ, "
"ການຊຳລະຜ່ານມືຖື ແລະ ບັດຂອງຂວັນ ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ POS ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Basics</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ພື້ນຖານ</strong>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Choose the best deal</strong>: Pick the vendor offering the best "
"deal for the requested materials."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ເລືອກຂໍ້ສະເໜີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ</strong>: ເລືອກຜູ້ສະໜອງທີ່ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ສະເໜີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບວັດຖຸດິບທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Create a Purchase Order</strong>: Order the flowers, plants, and "
"accessories you need for your business."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຊື້</strong>: ສັ່ງຊື້ດອກໄມ້, ຕົ້ນໄມ້ ແລະ ອຸປະກອນເສີມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສຳລັບທຸລະກິດຂອງ"
"ທ່ານ."

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Create tailored sales quotations: </strong>Generate a customized "
"Sales Quotation for weddings, birthdays, or corporate floral events, "
"directly on the sales app."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ສ້າງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ: </strong>ສ້າງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງສະເພາະສຳລັບງານດອງ, "
"ວັນເກີດ, ຫຼື ງານດອກໄມ້ຂອງບໍລິສັດ ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໃນແອັບການຂາຍ."

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Extend your offerings: </strong>Configure Gift Cards to offer "
"flexible floral gifts and provide more options for your clients."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກສິນຄ້າ: </strong>ຕັ້ງຄ່າບັດຂອງຂວັນເພື່ອມອບຂອງຂວັນດອກໄມ້ທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ ແລະ ເພີ່ມທ"
"າງເລືອກໃຫ້ແກ່ລູກຄ້າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Manage customer requests</strong>: Track customer inquiries coming "
"from your Website (such as wedding floral requests or custom bouquet "
"orders), manage engagement, follow up easily, and convert them into "
"confirmed sales\n"
"            opportunities."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຈັດການຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍຂອງລູກຄ້າ</strong>: ຕິດຕາມການສອບຖາມຂອງລູກຄ້າທີ່ມາຈາກເວັບໄຊຂອງທ່ານ "
"(ເຊັ່ນ: ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍດອກໄມ້ງານດອງ ຫຼື ການສັ່ງເຮັດຊໍ່ດອກໄມ້ພິເສດ), ຈັດການການມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມ, ຕິດຕາມຜົນໄດ້ງ່າຍ "
"ແລະ ປ່ຽນໃຫ້ເປັນໂອກາດ\n"
"            ການຂາຍທີ່ຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ."

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Organize event projects: </strong>Create a project to manage and "
"organize specific events, assign tasks, set deadlines, and track progress."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຈັດລະບຽບໂຄງການຈັດງານ: </strong>ສ້າງໂຄງການເພື່ອຈັດການ ແລະ ວາງແຜນງານສະເພາະ, ມ"
"ອບໝາຍວຽກ, ກຳນົດເວລາ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າ."

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Set up product offering: </strong>Create and configure your flower "
"products and add variants if you have different size or color for the same "
"product. You can also add an extra charges for specific options (e.g., +£2 "
"for a\n"
"            red tulip, +£10 for a medium bouquet)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຕັ້ງຄ່າສິນຄ້າ: </strong>ສ້າງ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າສິນຄ້າດອກໄມ້ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ເພີ່ມລຸ້ນຍ່ອຍຫາກທ່ານມີຂ"
"ະໜາດ ຫຼື ສີທີ່ຕ່າງກັນສຳລັບສິນຄ້າດຽວກັນ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເພີ່ມຄ່າບໍລິການເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກສະເພາະ (ຕົວຢ່າ"
"ງ: +£2 ສຳລັບດອກທິວລິບ\n"
"            ສີແດງ, +£10 ສຳລັບຊໍ່ດອກໄມ້ຂະໜາດກາງ)."

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Showcase your floral vision and offer: </strong>Configure your "
"website to highlight your floral style, present your services and get new "
"opportunities through a contact form."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ສະແດງວິໄສທັດດ້ານດອກໄມ້ ແລະ ຂໍ້ສະເໜີຂອງທ່ານ: </strong>ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວັບໄຊຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອເນັ້ນເອກ"
"ະລັກຮູບແບບດອກໄມ້ຂອງທ່ານ, ນຳສະເໜີການບໍລິການ ແລະ ຮັບໂອກາດໃໝ່ໆຜ່ານແບບຟອມຕິດຕໍ່."

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Take orders in Point of Sale</strong>: Open a register and process "
"in-store purchases such as bouquets, flowers, cards, and more."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຮັບຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ໃນຈຸດຂາຍ (POS)</strong>: ເປີດກະ ແລະ ດຳເນີນການຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານ ເຊັ່ນ: ຊໍ່ດອກໄ"
"ມ້, ດອກໄມ້, ບັດ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Use Case</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ກໍລະນີການນຳໃຊ້</strong>"

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>You didn't import demo data?</strong> You can still do it. Go to "
"<strong>Apps &gt; Industries &gt; Upgrade your Florist Package</strong> and "
"check the related box."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງແມ່ນບໍ່?</strong> ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຕອນນີ້. ໄປທີ່ <strong>ແອັ"
"ບ &gt; ກຸ່ມທຸລະກິດ &gt; ອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດຮ້ານດອກໄມ້ຂອງທ່ານ</strong> ແລ້ວໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຫ້ອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Add the <strong>eCommerce </strong>features to extend your floral business."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຄຸນສົມບັດ <strong>eCommerce </strong>ເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍທຸລະກິດດອກໄມ້ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: florist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:florist.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Add<strong> product categories</strong> to organize your point of sales and "
"make your products easier to find during busy periods. (e.g. Bouquets, "
